actually means to me,

00:54:56.860 --> 00:54:57.793
in terms of,

00:55:00.710 --> 00:55:03.670
I think part of it is validating

00:55:03.670 --> 00:55:05.420
that I still have a spiritual,

00:55:05.420 --> 00:55:07.120
I'm still on a spiritual journey.

00:55:07.120 --> 00:55:10.393
You know, I'm not defined
by what I'm not anymore.

00:55:14.120 --> 00:55:17.323
I'm alive, you know, I've got,

00:55:19.890 --> 00:55:22.000
and I've this moment,

00:55:22.000 --> 00:55:24.210
we're sharing this moment.

00:55:24.210 --> 00:55:29.040
And there's so much beauty

00:55:29.040 --> 00:55:32.810
that we can enjoy and
appreciate, or we can miss.

00:55:32.810 --> 00:55:36.550
And, I'm sure that includes

00:55:36.550 --> 00:55:38.090
