00:55:43.310 --> 00:55:46.880
It was, these things are going to happen.

00:55:46.880 --> 00:55:51.080
Who am, I'm not, you know,
tragedy suffering, loss, death.

00:55:51.080 --> 00:55:56.080
These are not things that I
want to try my best to avoid.

00:55:56.740 --> 00:55:58.750
You know, who am I to expect

00:55:58.750 --> 00:56:02.040
for these things not to happen
to me and people that I love?

00:56:02.040 --> 00:56:03.143
Things happen.

00:56:08.650 --> 00:56:12.700
And giving myself permission to say,

00:56:12.700 --> 00:56:16.570
You know what, this is not only my life,

00:56:16.570 --> 00:56:19.160
but this is my spiritual practice.

00:56:19.160 --> 00:56:20.140
And...

00:56:24.550 --> 00:56:25.603
I'm good with it.

00:56:30.530 --> 00:56:33.709
I have a level of peace at this point,

00:56:33.709 --> 00:56:37.970
and I'm moving forward, hopefully.

00:56:37.970 --> 00:56:42.493
- Well, love being your
guide as, you know,

00:56:45.750 --> 00:56:48.423
60's, peace, and love, as it sounds,

